  "notes": "The pattern is the ledger header, so the variant has no focus transaction and expect lists no participants, state changes or movements. Python stellar-sdk 17.0.x and Java stellar-sdk 6.0.0 decode this ledger (same matrix row). The upgrade ledger just before it, cap-0088/upgrade-ledger-header-30-whole-second-value, still uses the SIGNED arm and decodes in every SDK version tested. Protocol 30 readiness (not known divergences: a schema that predates Protocol 30 refusing an undeclared union arm is the expected clean refusal, judged n_a by the conformance runner's schema-reach rule): @stellar/stellar-sdk 16.3.0-16.3.1 and 17.2.0-17.2.1, go-stellar-sdk v0.7.1-v0.7.3 and stellar-xdr (crates.io) 28.0.0-28.0.1 refuse this ledger at L0 because StellarValue.ext arm 3 is undeclared; versions with the Protocol 30 schema decode it. Executed in the SDK matrix probe (evidence/sdk-matrix, vector 10l5540314)."
